```

The remaining is the same on Unix and Windows:

```lang-starlark

# first will link to libmylib.a (or libmylib.lib)
cc_binary(
  name = "first",
  srcs = ["first.cc"],
  deps = [":mylib"],
  linkstatic = 1, # default value
)

# second will link to libmylib.so (or libmylib.lib)
