	toolchain~        The target representing the actual tool or tool suite that is made available when this
        toolchain is selected.
 2Nonex
v
toolchain_type\The label of a `toolchain_type` target that represents the role that this
 toolchain serves. 2Noneü
ú
use_target_platform_constraintsÒIf `True`, this toolchain behaves as if its `exec_compatible_with` and
 `target_compatible_with` constraints are set to those of the current target
 platform. `exec_compatible_with` and `target_compatible_with` must not
 be set in that case.2Falseü
