This `features` attribute is combined with the [package](#package) level `features` attribute. For example, if
the features \["a", "b"\] are enabled on the package level, and a target's
`features` attribute contains \["-a", "c"\], the features enabled for the
rule will be "b" and "c".
[See example](https://github.com/bazelbuild/examples/blob/main/rules/features/BUILD).(À
